<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;">      &quot;pageContent&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">: </span><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;">&quot;France is a country in Western Europe. Its capital Paris...&quot;</span></span>
